title: duplicates:activate
tags: [[GUI command]] Duplicates
kind: reference
summary: Duplicates: unfold the group / show the copy (here / other / new)

`duplicates:activate <here|other|new>` — Enter in the [[duplicates panel]]. On a group row it unfolds or folds the group, like [[duplicates:toggle-group]]; on a copy it shows it in a [[viewer panel]] at the [[open target|Panel slots and layout]] — `panel:open <target> file`, as the copy's `↗` does ([[Opening a row]]).
